OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader to face vote after
OL,4,ALabour decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader is set to face a vote
OL,7,Fof no confidence next week amid claims
OL,8,Fhis Green group does not have the
OL,9,F"calibre" to run the authority alone.
OL,11,FThe Green-Labour coalition that has run
OL,12,FWarwick District Council since 2023 is
OL,13,Fbeing dissolved by Labour over a new
OL,14,FGreen Party policy that declared
OL,15,FZionism as racism.
OL,17,FLabour chair Bridget Phillipson issued
OL,18,Fan ultimatum to local Green leaders to
OL,19,Freject the policy and call on national
OL,20,Ffigures to intervene or see their
OL,21,Farrangements pulled apart.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
