OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader to face vote after
OL,4,ALabour decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarwick council leader Ian Davison said
OL,7,Fhe was "very happy... the talent we
OL,8,Fhave is great". Former leader
OL,9,FConservative Andrew Day stated he had
OL,10,Fsecured the signatures required for an
OL,11,Furgent council meeting.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
